# The town mobs' specials, run with @spec as mobile_update would (it isn't ported until P4 PR 6), at the entrance
# to Mud School (3700), with only area_update running. Smokegod (60) sets things up. Outlaw (18) is a killer and a
# thief, Purser (10) has coins, Decimus (10) is broke, and Heroic (51) is the one a drunk picks a fight with.
# - fido devours a drunk's corpse and drops the bottle that was in it, then finds no more
# - the janitor, asleep, does nothing; awake, it picks up a bottle of beer, not a scimitar or a pie
# - Hassan (executioner) yells that Outlaw is a KILLER and attacks, then, fighting, does nothing more; a
#   cityguard, once Outlaw is pardoned of that, yells THIEF; pardoned of both, there's no one, until a fido (-200)
#   and a drunk (400) attack Heroic (750), and a guard goes for the fido, the most evil of those fighting under 300
# - a thief (8) works the room 100 times, taking coins or caught at it
# - the nasty thief (30) finds no one between 31 and 39; set to level 10, it backstabs Outlaw, with no weapon, so
#   murders him, then robs him or flees
# - the adept (30) casts at the players under 11 it can see
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
goto 3700
holylight
@connect out
Outlaw
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect purse
Purser
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect hero
Heroic
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
transfer outlaw 3700
transfer purser 3700
transfer heroic 3700
set char outlaw hp 5000
restore outlaw
set char heroic hp 30000
restore heroic
@mob 3064 3700
@obj 3001 3700
force drunk get bottle
slay drunk
@mob 3062 3700
@spec 2
purge
@obj 3001 3700
@obj 3005 3700
@obj 3009 3700
@mob 3061 3700
force janitor sleep
@spec
force janitor wake
@spec 3
purge
@mob 3011 3700
@spec
@spec
peace
@pulse 12
pardon outlaw killer
@mob 3060 3700
@spec
peace
@pulse 12
pardon outlaw thief
@spec
@mob 3062 3700
force fido kill heroic
@mob 3064 3700
force drunk kill heroic
@pulse 12
@mob 3060 3700
@spec
peace
@pulse 12
purge
restore outlaw
restore heroic
@mob 3005 3700
@spec 100
purge
set char outlaw gold 100
@mob 3163 3700
@spec
set char thief level 10
@spec 12
purge
goto 3700
transfer outlaw 3700
restore outlaw
transfer decimus 3700
@mob 3707 3700
@spec 60
purge
@state
